--- !u!1001 &7315541498022367476
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1932641877}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _deityName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The roots are quiet. That is how it should be.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Welcome to our village, little diver. Few from the dry world swim this
        far into the roots.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: The fishers above take everything their nets touch. The young, the rare,
        the ones the sea cannot spare.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Then how should anyone fish?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: With care. Take only what is needed, and let the rest swim free. Your
        woven net knows the way, if you do.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Our fishers will teach you. Learn to see which fish may be taken, and
        which must be left in peace.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The fish you carry need new homes. But beyond the trench lies the deep,
        and something sleeps there that does not like to be woken.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].speakerName
      value: '{player}'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Every school taken with care, and not one protected life harmed. You
        have learned well.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The village has something for you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Keep it close. It was made by many hands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Thank you. I'll keep it safe.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Kataw Elder
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0].speakerName
