    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: My herds rest easy now. Go safely.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: "A diver, and a dugong beside you\u2026 Come closer. My light is weak
        tonight."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: I am Manunubo. I keep the herds of these waters. But the sharks prowl
        the open sand, and my fish have scattered in fear.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: How can I help them?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: You carry a conch that sings of home. Blow it, and the lost ones will
        hear you and follow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Stay in the seaweed and the narrow rocks when the hunters pass. Ride
        with your dugong and they will take you for one of my herd.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[5].text
      value: Bring my herds back to me, {player}.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: East, through the channel, the Kataw keep their village in the roots.
        They will teach you what my herds cannot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'Look: the tide is already moving east, silver in the dark. Swim into
        it, and it will carry you.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _idleLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[2].speakerName
      value: '{player}'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[3].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[4].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _questLines.Array.data[5].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _closingLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: They are home. Can you see? My light grows stronger with every herd.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: You swam where the hunters swim and never once left a fish behind.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'Take this gift: Moontide. The tides that carried my herds will show
        themselves to you, and carry you as they carried them.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: "I can see the currents\u2026 the water is moving with me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2].isPlayer
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3235288655811664732, guid: 66d0e21bd799b4c0a91a24162a654cf1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _barks.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Manunubo
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
